//  SINGLE-LEG MAKER SPREAD STRATEGY
//
//  ENTRY:  |spread - mean| >= ENTRY_MULT × feeCost (single-leg round-trip)
//          signal is still derived from both legs' spread, but only
//          leg 2 (BRENT) is executed — the alpha leg per backtest analysis.
//
//  EXIT:   Purely profit-target / stop-loss based (dollar P&L on the leg).
//          All exit orders are limit (maker). No spread-reversion exit.
//
//  Data analysis (767 trades pair 1):
//    legA (CL)   total PnL: -$2.38  | win rate: 52%
//    legB (BRENT) total PnL: +$8.12 | win rate: 81%  ← execute this leg only
//
//  Optimal PT/SL from backtest grid:
//    profitTarget = $0.025  (pair-level override via DB)
//    stopLoss     = $0.035  (pair-level override via DB)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

